1
00:00:00,334 --> 00:00:00,567
Hi!

2
00:00:00,567 --> 00:00:03,204
This is a walkthrough of SeeUinAI.

3
00:00:03,204 --> 00:00:06,695
It shows how often AI assistants like ChatGPT

4
00:00:06,695 --> 00:00:09,487
mention your brand in their answers.

5
00:00:10,190 --> 00:00:12,335
We start on the home page.

6
00:00:12,335 --> 00:00:15,058
Click Login to create an account.

7
00:00:15,764 --> 00:00:18,692
Sign-up takes half a minute: an email,

8
00:00:18,692 --> 00:00:21,774
a password of at least eight characters,

9
00:00:21,774 --> 00:00:23,237
and a project name.

10
00:00:23,237 --> 00:00:25,317
The newsletter is optional.

11
00:00:26,012 --> 00:00:28,406
Next, we introduce the brand.

12
00:00:28,406 --> 00:00:31,789
Enter the website, the brand name and the

13
00:00:31,789 --> 00:00:34,595
target market, then press Analyze.

14
00:00:35,310 --> 00:00:38,190
The AI already knows something about the

15
00:00:38,190 --> 00:00:41,071
company and retells it in its own words.

16
00:00:41,071 --> 00:00:43,088
If that's right, we confirm.

17
00:00:43,794 --> 00:00:47,396
The service suggests commercial search phrases.

18
00:00:47,396 --> 00:00:50,461
Pick the relevant ones and add your own.

19
00:00:50,461 --> 00:00:51,917
Up to ten in total.

20
00:00:57,126 --> 00:00:59,596
Each phrase gets a relevance score.

21
00:00:59,596 --> 00:01:03,759
We mark the queries we want to track and press Get results.

22
00:01:08,038 --> 00:01:09,665
This is the main screen.

23
00:01:09,665 --> 00:01:12,377
Every query is sent to a language model,

24
00:01:12,377 --> 00:01:15,767
and the service checks whether your site is cited.

25
00:01:16,476 --> 00:01:20,617
Visibility is the share of answers where the brand was found.

26
00:01:20,617 --> 00:01:24,214
Average position is where it ranks among the sources.

27
00:01:24,214 --> 00:01:26,658
The charts build up a daily history.

28
00:01:27,365 --> 00:01:29,979
Below you can see the score for each query

29
00:01:29,979 --> 00:01:32,344
and the list of sites the AI links to.

30
00:01:33,059 --> 00:01:36,993
A report with recommendations can be sent to your email.

31
00:01:42,187 --> 00:01:43,876
Want to grow faster?

32
00:01:43,876 --> 00:01:44,889
Pick a plan.

33
00:01:44,889 --> 00:01:48,098
In this demo the payment is simulated:

34
00:01:48,098 --> 00:01:50,716
Stripe is replaced with a stub.

35
00:01:51,425 --> 00:01:55,304
The payment went through, and we return to the dashboard.

36
00:01:55,996 --> 00:01:57,615
Finally, we log out.

37
00:01:57,615 --> 00:02:02,069
The token is removed and the dashboard is locked again.

38
00:02:02,797 --> 00:02:03,701
That's it.

39
00:02:03,701 --> 00:02:07,230
Diagrams and details are in the README.

40
00:02:07,230 --> 00:02:09,040
Thanks for watching!
